   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "WIREFRAME NOTE \u2014 this slide is diagram-led, not prose-led. Same skeleton both halves: PAIN (red label) \u2192 SOLUTION (green band) \u2192 mechanism flow \u2192 result strip. The 109.9% gold box is the single takeaway.",
